## Instructions

This template is used when {{ org_name }} commits to serve as the Research Institution (RI) partner on an STTR proposal, or as a research subcontractor on an SBIR proposal. The completed letter is provided to the small business concern (SBC) for inclusion in the proposal package.

**When to use this template:**

- The SBC requests a letter of institutional commitment for an STTR or SBIR proposal.
- The Executive Director has reviewed and approved the Organization's participation per the STTR/SBIR Research Institution Partnership Policy (Section 10).

**Preparation:** Replace all `{{ '{{placeholder}}' }}` fields with proposal-specific information. Print on {{ org_name }} letterhead. The Executive Director signs as the authorized institutional official.

